{"type":"message","id":"9b8442bb","parentId":"898a11a0","timestamp":"2026-03-14T19:39:47.191Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"244303944","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# MEMORY.md — Knowledge Tracking System Memory\n\n## 🧠 Long-Term Knowledge: The Smart Learning & Analysis Engine\n\n### 🎯 Core Purpose\nA comprehensive knowledge tracking system that:\n1. Tracks daily briefs from @intothecryptoverse YouTube channel\n2. Analyzes videos for key insights and market-moving information\n3. Organizes knowledge into 5 categories with SRS flashcards\n4. Maintains deep summaries for every analyzed video\n\n---\n\n## 📂 Key Files & Their Purpose\n\n### Analysis Engine\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `analyzer.py` | Main analysis logic + **SRS flashcard generation** + categorization engine |\n| `tracker.py` | Video tracking with deep summary generation |\n| `flashcard_history.json` | SRS review scheduling and progress tracking |\n\n### Dashboards\n- **Gaps Dashboard**: Interactive flashcards with category badges, flip-to-reveal answers\n- **Mimic Dashboard**: Premium Cyberpunk HUD for market analysis data\n\n---\n\n## 🏷️ Category System (Implemented 2026-03-14)\n\nEach knowledge piece is tagged with one or more categories:\n\n| Badge | Category | Focus |\n|-------|----------|-------|\n| 📈 | ECONOMICS | Macro trends, inflation data, economic indicators |\n| ₿ | CRYPTO | Bitcoin, altcoins, blockchain developments |\n| 🧮 | MATHEMATICS | Regression analysis, statistical models, quantitative methods |\n| 🏛️ | FED | Interest rates, monetary policy, central banking |\n| 📊 | SP500 | Equities market analysis, S&P performance |\n\n---\n\n## 🔬 Value Flagging System\n\n**🔥 High Value**: Critical information (e.g., major Bitcoin updates, significant economic shifts)\n**⚪ Normal**: Routine updates and standard market commentary\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Spaced Repetition Logic\n\nCards progress through review stages:\n1. **New** → First exposure to a concept\n2. **Learning** → Active study period\n3. **Review Due** → SRS algorithm indicates re-review needed\n4. **Mastered** → Confident recall achieved\n\nReview intervals increase based on performance:\n- Correct answer: Extend interval (e.g., 1 day → 3 days → 7 days → 30 days)\n- Incorrect answer: Reset to earlier stage for reinforcement\n\n---\n\n## 📊 What the System Tracks\n\nFor each video/knowledge piece:\n- ✅ Date analyzed\n- ✅ Primary category (with badges for multi-tagging)\n- 🔥 High Value flag\n- 💡 Benjamin Cowen-style answers stored\n- 📅 Last review date (SRS scheduling)\n- 🔄 Review count and mastery level\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Important Notes\n\n1. **Daily Brief Migration**: The `mimic` repo will be remade with future data when Benjamin stops YouTube content\n2. **GitHub Pages Deployment**: All dashboards deploy via GitHub Pages workflows\n3. **Telegram Integration**: Primary platform for link sharing and briefs\n4. **Riyadh Timezone**: All operations scheduled according to Asia/Riyadh (GMT+3)\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 System Health Check\n\nBefore each major operation, verify:\n- [ ] Gateway service running on port 18789\n- [ ] LM Studio health at `http://100.67.202.80:3003/v1`\n- [ ] All Python scripts have execute permissions\n- [ ] GitHub Pages workflows are active for dashboard repos\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773517187190}}
